{"w":["2026-11-16","2026-11-22"],"built":"2026-11-16T03:04Z","pending":64,"N":["","Musashi NZ describes Plant Protein as a \"vegan friendly formula\".","Nature's Way NZ Matcha Powder: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO, no added sugar.\"","Nature's Way NZ Kids Superfood Shake: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO, soy free.\"","Nature's Way NZ Beetroot Powder: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO.\"","Nature's Way NZ Spirulina Powder: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO, soy free.\"","Twinings' English Breakfast product page (10/50/100 bags) shows a \"Vegan\" badge; ingredient is black tea.","Ben & Jerry's Australian flavour page shows a Vegan badge for the non-dairy Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough.","Uncle Tobys' product page marks Shredded Wheat as \"Vegan friendly\"; ingredient is 100% whole grain wheat.","L'OR FAQ: \"The coffee in our L'Or Espresso capsules is suitable for both vegetarian and vegan diet.\"","Uncle Tobys' product page marks Cheerios Original as \"Vegan friendly\".","Woolworths NZ description: \"naturally gluten-free, vegan & GMO free\".","Woolworths NZ pack claim lists \"vegan; gluten free; GMO free\".","Woolworths NZ description: \"Our cider vinegar crisps are 100% vegan and gluten free\".","Leggo's product page states \"Suitable for vegans and vegetarians\".","Massel states: \"All our products are vegan and always have been.\"","Rebel Bakehouse's product page says its Brioche Style bagels are vegan friendly.","Rebel Bakehouse's product page says its Sesame Seed bagels are vegan friendly.","Rebel Bakehouse's product page says its Herb & Black Garlic bagels are vegan friendly.","Rebel Bakehouse's product page says its Low Carb Max bagels are vegan friendly.","Rebel Bakehouse's product page says its Sourdough bagels are vegan friendly.","Health Lab's FAQ: \"Yes, all of our products are vegan-friendly.\"","Woolworths NZ pack claim says vegan, but flavour enhancer 635 (source unstated) is listed by Calbee; check first.","Trident's